  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5663ecf42d54ced6",
      "translationZh": "我基本上为本地模型打造了一个本地版的 Claude code。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3ed4e9c8ac7e8c5f",
      "translationZh": "就这么简单！模型和 llama.cpp 二进制文件会按需下载。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8f0296e3028513c6",
      "translationZh": "我确实对这些模型做了大量研究，而且在我这边进行了海量的全面测试后，最终选定了以下这组模型：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "48a80234c695e587",
      "translationZh": "Tiny -> LFM 2.5 2.6B（官方 QAT q4）-> 4gb 显存或 8gb 内存",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c7b665e50d42b482",
      "translationZh": "Lite -> Ornith 1.5 9B（官方 Q4）-> 8gb 显存或 12 gb 内存",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ba5226c20905d291",
      "translationZh": "Pro -> Qwen 3.8 27b（社区 QAT Q2）-> 16gb 显存或 16gb 内存",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "52326080313c6e2d",
      "translationZh": "我还统一使用了 Q5 KV，对我来说效果很好；试试看，要是不好用就告诉我。我可以把它提高到 Q6。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fe05f6fc2345953a",
      "translationZh": "还为 Lite 和 Pro 添加了 Dflash 草稿模型，让大家运行它们时能更快！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c7f6db0f866ef284",
      "translationZh": "注意：默认使用通用的最优设置；你可以在 .golden_agent/inference.json 文件中修改这些设置。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2e556b261a0fe1fb",
      "translationZh": "tiny 的选择相当明显；它在同等参数规模的模型中遥遥领先，是目前最先进的模型。Ornith 1.5 9B 也非常不错，看起来是 9B 这个无人问津的规模附近最好的模型。当然，我们也必须拿下本地 LLM 之王 Qwen 3.8 27B。现在我知道，非常多的人一直因为硬件限制而无法使用它，所以我找到了这个社区 QAT Q2，简直捡到宝了！HF 模型卡上的数字也算是印证了这一点：如果你以 0.7 的温度和 1.05 的重复惩罚运行它，我个人几乎完全看不出它与采用 0.7 的温度、不加重复惩罚（按 Unsloth 的建议）的 Unsloth v3 UD Q4 量化版本有什么区别，所以我希望这能让更多更多的人用上它。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "71c9f29794e4fd59",
      "translationZh": "代码仓库：https://github.com/yashneil75/Golden-Agent",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8be97051c573da54",
      "translationZh": "未来版本将推出：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c466b038befeb0c9",
      "translationZh": "注意：我确实重新发了这个帖子，因为之前那篇写得有点糟……总之！我一直在围绕易用性和“直接就能用”的体验做优化，我也知道你们更偏向于“纯粹出于热爱，我宁愿花 10 个小时自己优化它”，但还是试试看吧，告诉我你们的想法，哦，别忘了点个 Star！！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "175ac57a4312f1af",
      "translationZh": "由 /u/Square_Light1441 提交",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
